r 3, 2026:Pre-Dawn: Before Hollis cuts the exterior copper phone trunk, Maya faxes a single cropped scan of the lobby Guest Ledger—bearing her margin note "Don't trust him" in back-slanted blue cursive—to Sloane's overnight compliance desk in Boston, knowing Sloane will use it to hire Clara.10:00 AM (Portland): Sloane meets Clara at Becky's Diner, offers her $45,000 to inventory Blackthorne Lodge, hides an Iridium satellite burst-transceiver inside Clara's leather NDA portfolio so Clara will lead her to Arthur's corpse before Friday at 5:00 PM, and flips over the lodge photo to show Clara Maya's handwriting.Dusk (Blackthorne Lodge): While Hollis is out paying Essex County Deputy Enoch Pike to block the lower county road with his snowplow and padlocking his F-250 inside the carriage barn, Maya slips down the dumbwaiter, slices her page out of the lobby Guest Ledger, glues the ROOM 4 — ATTIC EAST brass tag to the spine with warm hide glue, and wedges the sliced page (with a map to Arthur's body in the Icehouse and the coal chute) into the Room 4 radiator fins.Clara arrives, finds the charred Vane Biotech voucher corner ($145,000.00) in the hearth, spots Hollis's three-fingered oil print on the third-floor fire door, proves the snowmobiles were siphoned rather than idled, finds Celeste's Moncler coat and shredded VaneCor autopsy transfers in Hollis's F-250, discovers Hollis severed her Civic's tire chains and ignition harness, and hears Maya whisper through the sub-basement coal chute at midnight.Thursday, December 4 – Friday Morning, December 5, 2026:Morning/Afternoon: Clara inventories the Master Suite, finds the $38,000,000 Survivorship Covenant and the lavender-oil-smudged brandy stopper, snowshoes down to the county road where she catches Deputy Pike with Hollis's cash bribe—right as county dispatch flags Maya's Wednesday pre-dawn fax—and climbs back up to break into Room 4.Evening: Clara recovers Maya's Icehouse map from the Room 4 radiator, slips down the chimne